&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;（a）税務上の繰越欠損金は、法定実効税率を乗じた額であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:58.5pt;text-indent:-18pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(&lt;span&gt;2023年７月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
